e-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;2.939.274&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 12.9pt"&gt;&lt;td style="height: 12.9pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 276.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: white; border: none; border-bottom: double windowtext 1.5pt; height: 12.9pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 101.15pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;3.316.754&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="background: white; height: 12.9pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 10.4pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: white; border: none; border-bottom: double windowtext 1.5pt; height: 12.9pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 92.45pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;3.335.578&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraph" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 18.0pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;(a)&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;En diciembre de 2013 Celsia realizó su primera emisión de bonos ordinarios en el mercado de valores local por un monto de $800.000. La colocación se hizo a través de una subasta holandesa en la Bolsa de Valores de Colombia S.A.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 18.0pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Los bonos ordinarios, que son a la orden y pueden ser negociados en el mercado secundario a través de la Bolsa de Valores de Colombia S.A., fueron adjudicados así:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="586" style="border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: 32.5pt; width: 439.45pt"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 11.35pt"&gt;&lt;td style="height: 11.35pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 137.6pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Referencia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 11.35pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 49.6pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;qu