ción de bienes inmuebles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 13.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 16.05pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; height: 13.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 77.3pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;2.213&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="height: 13.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 14.55pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; height: 13.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 77.3pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;1.416&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 13.6pt"&gt;&lt;td style="height: 13.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 269.95pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;Total gastos de administración&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="height: 13.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 16.05pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="border: none; border-bottom: double windowtext 2.25pt; height: 13.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 77.3pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;302.815&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="height: 13.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 14.55pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="border: none; border-bottom: double windowtext 2.25pt; height: 13.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 77.3pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;296.341&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;El crecimiento de los gastos de administración obedece principalmente a:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 18.0pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Symbol"&gt;·&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;        &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Deterioro de cuentas comerciales por cobrar ocasionada por la condición actual de contingencia por el COVID 19 que se focaliza en los estratos en los cuales se han presentado menores porcentajes de recaudo, reconociendo un deterioro de $15.689.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 18.0pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Symbol"&gt;·&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;        &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Amortizaciones en sistemas de información, &lt;span class="normaltextrun"&gt;&lt;span style="background: white"&gt;que dentro de los más relevantes se encuentra el software del sistema de información comercial &#8211; Esfera.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 18.0pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Symbol"&gt;·&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;        &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Mantenimiento y reparaciones en instalaciones, &lt;span class="normaltextrun"&gt;&lt;span style="background: white"&gt;principalmente en gastos de mantenimiento de sistemas de información.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="eop"&gt;&lt;span style="background: white"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ifrs:DisclosureOfGeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseExplanatory>
